                "*": "I'm actually thinking that the Liberals should either stop existing after the outbreak of the Second Civil War, or should be absorbed with some other minor parties to form a new party. \n\nAlso, I think I made a mistake saying the Libertarians existed in any meaningful sense past the 2030s. I need to re-examine the Political Parties page and make some changes.",
